---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import wristLeftImg from '../../assets/images/diver/wrist_left.png';
import numberpadImg from '../../assets/images/diver/numberpad.png';
import crewmatesImg from '../../assets/images/diver/crewmates.png';
import wristRightImg from '../../assets/images/diver/wrist_right.png';
import trackImg from '../../assets/images/diver/track.png';
import wristInputImg from '../../assets/images/diver/wrist_input.png';
import phoneInputImg from '../../assets/images/diver/phone_input.png';
import hangupInputImg from '../../assets/images/diver/hangup_input.png';
---
<PageLayout title="3D Diver Interface — Alex Sheen">
  <div class="base_padding">
    <div class="w3-row">
      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <div class="projtitle white_text" style="width:100%">
            3D Diver Interface
            <div class="projtext" style="width:100%">
              <br />
              <div class="vl">
                <i>Unity, Meta Oculus</i><br />
                2022<br />
              </div>
              <br />
              For CMSC 20300, Intro to Human-Computer Interaction, we were tasked with creating an <span class="beige_text">intuitive and functional HUD interface for scuba divers</span>.
              <br /><br />
              Our <span class="beige_text">design philosophy</span> focused on providing <span class="beige_text">fast access to frequently used functionality</span> and <span class="beige_text">inputs tailored for VR interactions</span>.
              <br /><br />
              To test our interface without a real scuba suit, we simulated
              the diver's underwater experience in virtual reality using an Oculus headset and a diving simulation running in Unity.
              <br /><br />
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XjCmiEwIndo"><span class="beige_text">Click me for a short video walk-through!</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={wristLeftImg} style="width:100%" alt="Wrist left" />
        </div>
        <div class="white_text base_container_padding" style="width:100%">
          The left wrist provides quick access to high priority buttons for the Crewmates Manager and the Radio. <br /><br />An SOS button is always accessible above for emergencies.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={numberpadImg} style="width:100%" alt="Number pad" />
        </div>
        <div class="white_text base_container_padding" style="width:100%">
          The Radio allows users to call crewmates.<br /><br />
          Our <span class="beige_text">horizontal numberpad design</span> encourages a swipe-through motion which <span class="beige_text">suits the VR environment better</span> than a typical 2D button-tap interface.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row">
      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={crewmatesImg} style="width:100%" alt="Crewmates" />
        </div>
        <div class="white_text base_container_padding" style="width:100%">
          The Crewmates Manager provides crewmate call and crewmate tracking buttons.<br /><br />
          Our <span class="beige_text">vertical interface design</span> allows users to swipe horizontally through their desired button.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={wristRightImg} style="width:100%" alt="Wrist right" />
        </div>
        <div class="white_text base_container_padding" style="width:100%">
          The right wrist provides real-time updates on Altitude and Time Spent Underwater.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={trackImg} style="width:100%" alt="Track" />
        </div>
        <div class="white_text base_container_padding" style="width:100%">
          A left hand pinch gesture triggers a green tracking arrow that points to the designated crewmate.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row">
      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={wristInputImg} style="width:100%" alt="Wrist input" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={phoneInputImg} style="width:100%" alt="Phone input" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w3-third base_container_padding">
        <div class="proj" style="width:100%">
          <Image src={hangupInputImg} style="width:100%" alt="Hangup input" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
